    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>is even</mtext><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>is odd</mtext><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi></math>. If for some <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>, is equal to:",
